<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Brew an already acidic coffee garnished with a wedge of more acidic lemon, meant to be juiced into the coffee before quickly consumed while hot. An acquired taste to be sure but lauded by those who do prefer it.-->
  <VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.description>用柠檬装点咖啡，喝之前会把果肉里的柠檬汁洒在咖啡里，让已经够酸的饮料更酸了。这种咖啡有着不少粉丝。</VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing espresso romano.-->
  <VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.jobString>正在制作罗马特浓咖啡</VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew espresso romano-->
  <VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.label>制作罗马特浓咖啡</VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Make a very strong and semi-sweet fruity tea. Floral notes dance around one's pallet at even the most dull scent. People who finish the drink feel strangely urged to colonize.-->
  <VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.description>制作一种甘甜的水果茶，能感到花香在盘子上舞动。喝完的人都感觉干劲十足。</VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making earl grey tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.jobString>正在制作格雷伯爵茶</VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make earl grey tea-->
  <VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.label>制作格雷伯爵茶</VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.label>
  <!--EN: Make a dark tea cut with water, chilled and garnished with a wedge of bright lemon.-->
  <VBE_MakeLemonTea.description>把冷透的红茶用柠檬装饰。</VBE_MakeLemonTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making lemon tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeLemonTea.jobString>正在制作柠檬茶</VBE_MakeLemonTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make lemon tea-->
  <VBE_MakeLemonTea.label>制作柠檬茶</VBE_MakeLemonTea.label>
  <!--EN: Squeeze a few lemons, mix the juice with water and add some sugar.-->
  <VBE_MixLemonade.description>榨几个柠檬，将汁水用水稀释并加糖</VBE_MixLemonade.description>
  <!--EN: Mixing lemonade.-->
  <VBE_MixLemonade.jobString>正在调制柠檬水</VBE_MixLemonade.jobString>
  <!--EN: mix lemonade-->
  <VBE_MixLemonade.label>调制柠檬水</VBE_MixLemonade.label>
